(6613027, 986992, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I like the framing.<br/> <br/>Some ideas that could help you in the future:<br/>* There is dome pretty apparent chromatic aberration in the leaves and around the tire. This is easily cleaned up in post processing and makes the image sharper.<br/> <br/>* The black point looks like it has been pushed up really high, eliminating a lot of detail in the ground.</td>', 'Nice idea. I like the framing. Some ideas that could help you in the future:* There is dome pretty apparent chromatic aberration in the leaves and around the tire. This is easily cleaned up in post processing and makes the image sharper. * The black point looks like it has been pushed up really high, eliminating a lot of detail in the ground.', '2011-12-07 17:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
