(6615375, 986718, 141542, '<td valign="top">A great shot, and the Hobbit is my favorite book.  You win.  Love the storybook look you achieved here, and I''m not sure how you did that at all, but very impressive.</td>', 'A great shot, and the Hobbit is my favorite book.  You win.  Love the storybook look you achieved here, and I''m not sure how you did that at all, but very impressive.', '2011-12-09 22:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6615377, 986677, 141542, '<td valign="top">Love this, fundamentally solid with a nice level horizon, proper long exposure, and a classic idea with beautiful colors for originality.  Well done!</td>', 'Love this, fundamentally solid with a nice level horizon, proper long exposure, and a classic idea with beautiful colors for originality.  Well done!', '2011-12-09 22:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6615378, 986008, 141542, '<td valign="top">I''ve never done astral photography, but I''m sure it''s time consuming.  Luckily that''s really paid off for you here.  Looks great, and I love the decision to include the mountain range, as opposed to including only the night sky which I''m sure would be entrancing on its own.  Well done!</td>', 'I''ve never done astral photography, but I''m sure it''s time consuming.  Luckily that''s really paid off for you here.  Looks great, and I love the decision to include the mountain range, as opposed to including only the night sky which I''m sure would be entrancing on its own.  Well done!', '2011-12-09 22:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6615379, 986027, 141542, '<td valign="top">Magazine worthy.  The centrality of the red color is well thought out and powerful. Great job!</td>', 'Magazine worthy.  The centrality of the red color is well thought out and powerful. Great job!', '2011-12-09 22:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6615380, 987008, 141542, '<td valign="top">I''m no math master, nor do I know exactly what I''m seeing in each bubble(?), but it''s a great piece of work nonetheless.</td>', 'I''m no math master, nor do I know exactly what I''m seeing in each bubble(?), but it''s a great piece of work nonetheless.', '2011-12-09 22:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6615381, 987075, 141542, '<td valign="top">This cracked me up, and it''s a great shot.  It seems like it''s composed a bit awkwardly, but that doesn''t take too much away from it.  Good job!</td>', 'This cracked me up, and it''s a great shot.  It seems like it''s composed a bit awkwardly, but that doesn''t take too much away from it.  Good job!', '2011-12-09 22:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
