(6616461, 987094, 30364, '<td valign="top">Oh bugger!  I had done all my votes but hadn''t realised that the deadline for getting my comments done was today.  And you were in my top three which means that I''d have awarded you an Order of the Thumb.  Would you still accept it on a (sorry) posthumous basis?<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>The picture is beautiful.  The taste is bitter/sweet; always so much more memorable than just the one thing or the other.  Thank you.</td>', 'Oh bugger!  I had done all my votes but hadn''t realised that the deadline for getting my comments done was today.  And you were in my top three which means that I''d have awarded you an Order of the Thumb.  Would you still accept it on a (sorry) posthumous basis?  The picture is beautiful.  The taste is bitter/sweet; always so much more memorable than just the one thing or the other.  Thank you.', '2011-12-12 01:47:17.000000', NULL, 0),
