(6616625, 987072, 12611, '<td valign="top">The silvery green tones and excellent composition work well here. You should not be surprised that you can whip something together in minutes and score well. This is photography, its all about your eye, its not painting chapel ceilings- its capturing a slice in time- with all the light, color, and what ever comes along with it, and you did it well here.</td>', 'The silvery green tones and excellent composition work well here. You should not be surprised that you can whip something together in minutes and score well. This is photography, its all about your eye, its not painting chapel ceilings- its capturing a slice in time- with all the light, color, and what ever comes along with it, and you did it well here.', '2011-12-12 09:41:15.000000', NULL, 0),
