(6618562, 987086, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well - if the challenge had finished the way I scored it, you''d have a nice shiny new virtual ribbon to display.  :-)  I placed this shot at the top of my list.  Really a lovely photo.  I bet there''s some stock photo life in this one as well.  I don''t say that in a negative way...I mean stock photo in a high art venue (not your avg magazine ad clip kinda thing).  Anyway, just wanted to say congrats on a nice score and a wonderful image.</td>', 'Well - if the challenge had finished the way I scored it, you''d have a nice shiny new virtual ribbon to display.  :-)  I placed this shot at the top of my list.  Really a lovely photo.  I bet there''s some stock photo life in this one as well.  I don''t say that in a negative way...I mean stock photo in a high art venue (not your avg magazine ad clip kinda thing).  Anyway, just wanted to say congrats on a nice score and a wonderful image.', '2011-12-14 21:19:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6618565, 986701, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like you connected with the appreciative commenters and viewers.  :-)  I''m glad you entered this; it''s a fun photo.</td>', 'Looks like you connected with the appreciative commenters and viewers.  :-)  I''m glad you entered this; it''s a fun photo.', '2011-12-14 21:21:53.000000', NULL, 0),
